<title>JAPAN: JGBs surrender much of day's gains but still up.</title>
<headline>JGBs surrender much of day's gains but still up.</headline>
<text>
<p>*10-year JGB futures surrendered most of the day's gains but still ended up slightly in Tokyo as large-lot sales emerged in late trade.</p>
<p>*Sales appear to be natural correction to sharp Friday rise, overseas, with support expected to hold near 123.80.</p>
</text>
